(26, 'Joanna', 'joannariggs33@gmail.com', '890657009', 'Subject: Video Promotion for studynested.com?\n\nHi,\r\n\r\nI just visited studynested.com and wondered if you\'d ever thought about having an engaging video to explain what you do?\r\n\r\nOur prices start from just $195 (USD).\r\n\r\nLet me know if you\'re interested in seeing samples of our previous work.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nJoanna', 1, '2026-07-07 07:50:35', '2026-07-07 07:50:35'),
(27, 'Kate', 'katearmstrong1976@gmail.com', '500284187', 'Subject: The system we kept to ourselves for 6 years\n\nHi,\r\n\r\nWe\'ve spent the last 6 years building and refining an automated system that puts your business/offer directly in front of 30M+ website owners — with no manual outreach required.\r\n\r\nWe use it to drive our own growth, and it\'s engineered for high-volume online businesses, including:\r\n\r\nDigital Agencies & Consultants (prospecting for clients)\r\nSaaS, Software & Tech Products (driving signups)\r\nB2B Lead Generation companies (building inbound pipelines)\r\nAffiliate, CPA & Info-Product Marketers (scaling campaigns)\r\neCommerce Brands (reaching site owners at scale)\r\n\r\nIf you run an online offer and want direct access to millions of website owners without adding to your daily workload and would like more information, let me know.\r\n\r\nKate', 1, '2026-07-10 06:53:52', '2026-07-10 06:53:52'),
(28, 'Anaya', 'anaya.dgtlsolution@gmail.com', '9817689399', 'Subject: Re: SEO Recommendations for http://studynested.com\n\nHi,\r\n\r\nI hope you’re doing well.\r\n\r\nI wanted to reach out and see if you are interested in improving your website’s http://studynested.com visibility on Google and attracting more potential customers through SEO. We offer SEO solutions designed to help businesses increase organic traffic, improve keyword rankings, and generate quality inquiries.\r\n\r\nIf this sounds interesting, I’d be happy to share our complete SEO packages, activities, timeline, and pricing details for your review.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your response.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nAnaya', 1, '2026-07-16 16:47:06', '2026-07-16 16:47:06'),
