(32, 'Davidd', 'no.reply.EdwardOlsen@gmail.com', '83964757137', 'Subject: Do you want to bring in more customers for your business?\n\nGood morning! studynested.com, \r\nI discovered studynested.com while browsing the internet. \r\nWe provide a service for connecting with website owners . \r\nOur service helps companies introduce their services to websites. \r\nWe aim to keep the service accessible for businesses. \r\nYou can explore the service and see what it does. \r\nIf this relevant, feel free to contact us. \r\n \r\nHave a wonderful day. \r\nContact us. \r\nTelegram - https://t.me/FeedbackFormEU \r\nWhatsApp - +375259112693 \r\nWhatsApp  https://wa.me/+375259112693 \r\nWe only use chat for communication.', 1, '2026-07-28 01:19:28', '2026-07-28 01:19:28');
