(42, 3, 'Cello Butterflow Simply Ball Pen Set | Pack of 25 Ball Pens | 20 Blue and 5 Black Ink Colour Pens', 'Best Seller', NULL, 'Cello Butterflow Simply Ball Pen Set | Pack of 25 Ball Pens | 20 Blue and 5 Black Ink Colour Pens | Smooth Writing Experience | For School and Office Use | Best Pen for Exams', '<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 18px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Amazon Ember&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Pack Contents: Cello Butterflow Simply Ball Pen jar includes 25 Ball Pens (20 Blue, 5 Black Ink Colour), ensuring smooth writing experience.</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">No.1 Pen Brand: Continuing the promise of good quality and best product experience of Cello, Butterflow is No.1 pen brand in India.</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Exclusive Ink System: Equipped with an advanced tip design &amp; ink system, the Cello Butterflow Simply Ball Pen delivers the smoothest writing experience. The vibrant dark blue ink with 0.7mm tip for fine writing that sets it apart from the rest.</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Ergonomic Grip for Comfort: The Cello Butterflow Simply Ball Pen is designed for comfort and control, featuring a \"S Wave\" grip that allows you to write for longer periods without fatigue.</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Smart Choice: These Ball Pens are user friendly in a smart storage jar and ideal for daily use for students and professional both.</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Convenient Ink Level Window: The Ball pen ink indicator is visible through a window on the pen body, allowing you to effortlessly keep track of the ink levels.</span></li></ul>', 'Cello', 'Not Applicable', 1, 1, 1, '1770192418_0.jpg', 1, NULL, '2026-02-04 13:36:58', '2026-03-11 13:48:19'),
(43, 3, 'SLOVIC Steel Water Bottle 1 Ltr | Incredible India Design Fridge Water Bottle for School Kids', 'Best Seller', NULL, 'SLOVIC Steel Water Bottle 1 Ltr | Incredible India Design Fridge Water Bottle for School Kids | 100% BPA Free & leak-Proof | Sipper Water Bottles for Adults | Ideal for Gym, Office, Travel', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: &quot;Amazon Ember&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">STYLISH INCREDIBLE INDIA DESIGN] – The attractive print adds a unique and premium look to the bottle, making it stand out from regular water bottles.</span></p>', 'SLOVIC', 'Not Applicable', 1, 1, 1, '1770192589_0.jpg', 1, NULL, '2026-02-04 13:39:49', '2026-03-11 13:48:03'),
(44, 3, 'WATER BOTTLE (SEA BLUE)', 'Best Seller', NULL, 'WATER BOTTLE (SEA BLUE)', '<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 18px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Amazon Ember&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Adorable Design: Features a charming GREEN water bottle decorated with cute animal characters including a puppy with a flower on top and a purple deer, making hydration fun and appealing for kids</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Convenient Straw Mechanism: Equipped with a pop-up straw for easy sipping, allowing children to drink comfortably without tilting the bottle, perfect for school, outdoor activities, and travel</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Portable with Shoulder Strap: Comes with an adjustable shoulder strap featuring playful graphics, enabling kids to carry their water bottle hands-free with ease and convenience</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Child-Friendly Construction: Designed specifically for children with a secure lid, easy-grip body, and lightweight build that makes it simple for little hands to hold and operate independently</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Multi-Piece Stackable Design: The bottle features a creative stacking design with detachable components including character toppers and colourful sections, adding an element of play to everyday hydration</span></li></ul>', 'Katty mao', 'Not Applicabl