s can play with their children, so as to narrow the distance between them &amp; there child.</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">PERFECT GIFT FOR KIDS : This clay pack is an excellent gift for your baby or friend\'s kid for any occasion. It\'s made from high-quality ingredients, so it will never fall short of a mom\'s expectations.Children are happy to spend time playing and having fun with each variant. it is oil-based and never dries and never hardens. so kids can enjoy as long as they want. Creative clay pack is an excellent gift for your baby or friend\'s kid for any occasion. It\'s made from high-quality ingredients.</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">NON-STICKY MATERIAL: No smell, non-toxic, non sticky, non greasy, 100% Safe &amp; Environment Friendly. The Texture is soft, elastic, comfortable and not greasy which protects the soft hands of babies and children can enjoy playing without any problems.</span></li></ul>', 'Eclet', 'Not Applicable', 1, 1, 1, '1770206702_0.jpg', 1, NULL, '2026-02-04 17:35:02', '2026-03-11 14:04:00');
