(78, 2, 'School Girls Frock Uniform (Class 1-2) | Regular Fit Polycotton', 'Best Seller', NULL, 'Comfortable school frock uniform for girls of Class 1 and 2. Made with durable poly-cotton fabric, breathable and suitable for daily school use.', '<p>This Complete Girls School Uniform Kit includes all required uniform items for students of Class 1 to 3 at Carmel Convent School.\r\n\r\nThe combo is specially prepared to help parents purchase the entire school uniform in one package instead of buying items separately.\r\n\r\nAll items are made from durable, comfortable materials suitable for daily school use.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"width:420px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:12px;padding:25px;font-family:Arial;background:#fafafa\">\r\n\r\n<p data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"867\"><b style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">Select Uniform Items</b></p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"items\">\r\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:6px 0\">\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<label>\r\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"c0\" onchange=\"toggle(0)\">\r\nSchool Frock Uniform (₹499)\r\n</label>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"min-width:90px;text-align:right\">\r\n\r\n<button onclick=\"minus(0)\">−</button>\r\n\r\n<span id=\"q0\" style=\"padding:0 8px\">0</span>\r\n\r\n<button onclick=\"plus(0)\">+</button>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:6px 0\">\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<label>\r\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"c1\" onchange=\"toggle(1)\">\r\nSchool Dress (₹600)\r\n</label>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"min-width:90px;text-align:right\">\r\n\r\n<button onclick=\"minus(1)\">−</button>\r\n\r\n<span id=\"q1\" style=\"padding:0 8px\">0</span>\r\n\r\n<button onclick=\"plus(1)\">+</button>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:6px 0\">\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<label>\r\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"c2\" onchange=\"toggle(2