(972, 2, 'Boys School Shoes', 'Best Seller', NULL, 'Classic black lace school shoes designed for students, offering comfort, durability and a polished look for daily school wear.', '<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"934\">These black lace school shoes are designed to provide students with a comfortable and durable footwear option for everyday school use. Made from high-quality synthetic material with a strong sole, the shoes ensure long-lasting performance and reliable grip while walking or running. The lace-up design offers a secure and adjustable fit, while the sleek black finish maintains a neat and formal school appearance. Ideal for school uniforms, these shoes are lightweight, comfortable and suitable for long hours of wear.</p>', 'Campus', 'Boys', 1, 1, 1, '1773228185_0.jpg', 1, NULL, '2026-03-11 16:53:05', '2026-03-20 11:08:16'),
