(999, 3, 'Two Ruled', 'Best Seller', NULL, 'Supports improved handwriting with simple two-line ruling for structured writing.', '<p data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1688\">This Two Ruled Notebook is ideal for students transitioning to more refined handwriting. The two-line format helps maintain consistency in letter size and spacing. With 112 pages, it is suitable for classwork, homework, and practice sessions across various subjects.</p>', 'Notebook', 'Not Applicable', 0, 0, 0, '1774336647_0.png', 1, NULL, '2026-03-24 12:47:27', '2026-03-24 13:45:19'),
