(1061, 5, 'Math Lab', 'Best Seller', NULL, 'A mathematics lab activity notebook for practical and hands-on learning.', '<p>Math Lab (Navneet) is designed to help students understand mathematical concepts through activities, experiments, and practical exercises. The book encourages logical thinking, problem-solving, and interactive learning, making mathematics more engaging and easier to understand.</p>', 'Navneet', 'Not Applicable', 0, 0, 0, '1778734477_0.jpg', 1, NULL, '2026-05-14 10:24:37', '2026-06-25 16:04:39'),
